# Conformance probe pack for `until:` with `with` (spec 0.22, ruling 25;
# spec 0.18). Public. No kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   s1   8-bit characters up to NUL, written only when the entity holds x;
#        default "zz". Suppressed, it writes the terminator alone: neither
#        its text nor its default (ruling 1 of 0.18)
#   y    8 bits after it
#
# x is mapped by no line of this pack: an entity that holds it comes from
# `conformance-long-json`.
format     conformance-long-until-with
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
field   probe.s1  until:0  chars:ascii8  with probe.x
default probe.s1  zz
field   probe.y   8        uint
